we have:

```go
        username := os.Getenv("USER")
        if username == "" {
                var id string
                if os.Geteuid() == 0 {
                        id = strconv.Itoa(GetRootlessUID())
                } else {
                        id = strconv.Itoa(os.Geteuid())
                }
                userID, err := user.LookupId(id)
                if err == nil {
                        username = userID.Username
                }
        }
```

`os.Getenv` is an optimization because `user.LookupId` can be slow, I personally prefer to keep the faster version than having to workaround a broken env
